====== TP-Link Archer VR2600v v1 ======
{{media:tplink:archerc2600:c2600_case_front_1.jpg?200|Archer C2600}} 

Wireless-AC router based on QCA IPQ8064 with 16MB flash and 512MB RAM. Also sporting xDSL support with BCM63168 SOC and a DSP for VoIP POTS interface and DECT.

