==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

How to connect to the serial port of this specific device:
  - Open Device
  - Find space for four pin header name JP2 (next to WAN port)
  - Solder four pin header to JP2
  - Use MAX232 or UART to USB device for 3.3V
  - Pin1: TXD, Pin2: RXD, Pin3: GND, Pin4: 3.3V

Image below is from VR2600.  JP2 pinout is identical to VR2600v
